{"name": "Durga : The Lionhearted", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"180\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/58cf1e7385cbe6b1f9161b0343229bc7.avif?t=1784963809\" width=\"450\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/a4ebd1261b216f0acfa358e85dd6c3a9.poster.avif?t=1784963809\" width=\"512\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/a4ebd1261b216f0acfa358e85dd6c3a9.webm?t=1784963809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/a4ebd1261b216f0acfa358e85dd6c3a9.mp4?t=1784963809\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as <strong>Durga</strong>, a brave teenage girl from a forgotten village, as she embarks on a dangerous journey deep into ancient Indian forests. Inspired by epic tales from the Puranas, this story-driven adventure blends <strong>exploration, combat, and puzzle-solving</strong> into a cinematic experience where every choice matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"64\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/f8e1e735292815ee8e3b7745857bc1d9.avif?t=1784963809\" width=\"512\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Epic Animal Encounters</strong> \u2013 Outsmart and fight wild beasts like a massive cursed lion in thrilling, cinematic combat sequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Myth Meets Mystery</strong> \u2013 Discover ancient carvings, lost rituals, and forgotten deities hidden in overgrown temples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/8dee129b593a4112d65624bb912139fa.poster.avif?t=1784963809\" width=\"512\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/8dee129b593a4112d65624bb912139fa.webm?t=1784963809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/8dee129b593a4112d65624bb912139fa.mp4?t=1784963809\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Survive the Jungle</strong> \u2013 Gather herbs, craft remedies, and use nature\u2019s gifts to heal or calm enraged animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solve Mythical Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Unlock paths by choosing between forces of Dharma and Adharma, just like the heroes of old epics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Journey of Spirit</strong> \u2013 Witness Durga grow from a courageous villager to the guardian of an ancient legacy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/30e2c6f54994a1e3ac85f1ec2cb893ad.poster.avif?t=1784963809\" width=\"512\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/30e2c6f54994a1e3ac85f1ec2cb893ad.webm?t=1784963809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"